  "solution": {
    "text": "In given equation, putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />On adding both equations, we get,<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> …(i)<br />now, putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> …(ii)<br />Equation (ii) – Equation (i)<br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />∴Period <math><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>",
